You are welcome and encouraged to submit pull requests (PRs) strictly for the purpose of enhancing, adding, or correcting translations for the app. 

By submitting a pull request, you agree that your contributions are made voluntarily and that all rights to those contributions are immediately assigned to and become the exclusive property of **jaAPP**.

